{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：15:29 2026-10-21 HKT<br/>發佈時間：15:29 2026-10-21 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：15:29 2026-10-21 HKT</p><img alt=\"貨船船員燒垃圾，被誤作火警。蔡楚輝攝 \" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/2173136f535414a5f12da4bd9280fa3c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_15_00_25.jpeg\"/><p>今（21 日）下午2時12分，九龍城碼頭對開100米海面， 有途人發現一艘貨船起火冒煙，以為船上發生火警，報警求助，消防接報到場，證實是船員在船上燒垃圾，並非火警。事件中無人受傷。</p><img alt=\"貨船船員在船上燒垃圾，被誤會發生火警。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b6f4e0ec68164cb7b7f4c9f84a48767e/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_15_00_27_1_.jpeg\" title=\"貨船船員在船上燒垃圾，被誤會發生火警。蔡楚輝攝\"/><p>貨船船員在船上燒垃圾，被誤會發生火警。蔡楚輝攝</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/da1474d0541cdf82e109ca3d4a967599/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_15_00_24_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"九龍城碼頭對開，一艘貨船被誤為著火冒煙。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/47000c7404f587770a9ab72b770c3624/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_15_00_24_1_.jpeg\" title=\"九龍城碼頭對開，一艘貨船被誤為著火冒煙。蔡楚輝攝\"/><p>九龍城碼頭對開，一艘貨船被誤為著火冒煙。蔡楚輝攝</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/95a8353f489363c1611e25a58278cc4d/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_15_00_24.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T07:39:40.327574+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":222,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T07:29:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T12:18:13.908085+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T07:37:44.772861+00:00","content_hash":"780e50a0496fc5075855688f7a9c3f11ca1d0fd66a7583f588addb741b73ee10","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}